WEBVTT

00:16.680 --> 00:20.280
Your eyes that look far off
into the distance

00:20.280 --> 00:23.950
They're listening to the voice
within your heart

00:23.950 --> 00:28.120
Embracing a moon still blue

00:31.160 --> 00:34.830
Your strength to keep on running

00:34.830 --> 00:38.470
Will open another new door for you

00:38.470 --> 00:42.670
Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon

00:45.670 --> 00:53.050
Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you

00:53.050 --> 01:00.290
It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir

01:00.290 --> 01:03.930
What should we be searching for?

01:03.930 --> 01:07.560
Send out your soul

01:07.560 --> 01:14.330
We'll meet here again someday
if that's the truth

01:14.700 --> 01:18.410
Upon what should we fix our gaze?

01:18.410 --> 01:25.210
The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand

01:25.210 --> 01:28.880
Let it go, let's believe in it

01:46.330 --> 01:48.030
Where the hell are you guys
coming from?!

01:52.410 --> 01:53.870
I'm starting to get just
a bit tired of this!

01:59.250 --> 02:02.750
Hey, what's this?
Demon promotional week?

02:02.750 --> 02:07.450
Maybe it is. After all, this makes it
three days in a row!

02:19.770 --> 02:22.870
The "Attack Master Sanzo's
Party Tour," right?

02:22.870 --> 02:25.010
Man, don't any pretty companions
come with it?

02:25.010 --> 02:27.640
Tours usually come with
full course meals!

02:27.640 --> 02:31.280
Recently, there have been some
"All-You-Can-Eat Tours" too.

02:31.280 --> 02:33.110
That's my kind of tour!

02:33.110 --> 02:36.240
But this is near the point where
I want to say give me a break.

02:37.590 --> 02:40.990
All right, looks like the quota's
about ten per person.

02:40.990 --> 02:42.460
Sure thing!

02:47.360 --> 02:50.850
Why are you having such problems
taking out those boys?

02:52.030 --> 02:53.830
Really, Kougaiji.

02:56.400 --> 02:58.440
You don't seem to understand.

02:58.440 --> 03:01.010
What they're fighting now

03:01.010 --> 03:03.380
are corpses manipulated
by demonic powers.

03:03.380 --> 03:06.070
In other words, they're just
wasting their energy.

03:06.920 --> 03:12.090
So, when will you obtain
the scripture Sanzo has?

03:12.090 --> 03:13.360
Scripture?

03:13.360 --> 03:13.590
Yes, the scripture.
Scripture?

03:13.590 --> 03:14.990
Yes, the scripture.

03:29.040 --> 03:31.510
Don't you think something's
strange about these guys?

03:31.510 --> 03:34.510
No matter how many times we defeat
them, they just get back up again.

03:34.510 --> 03:36.340
They're practically like zombies
from a horror flick.

03:42.320 --> 03:44.380
Makai Tenjou!

03:49.520 --> 03:51.620
That thing's as awesome as ever.

03:53.230 --> 03:55.130
This is a special scripture.

03:55.130 --> 03:57.100
Defeating small fry like them is trivial.

03:59.300 --> 04:01.270
I need Buddhist scriptures.

04:01.840 --> 04:04.100
Circumstances have changed
here, you see.

04:05.170 --> 04:06.270
Circumstances?

04:06.270 --> 04:06.640
I guess I haven't told you yet.
Circumstances?

04:06.640 --> 04:09.040
I guess I haven't told you yet

04:11.150 --> 04:12.610
The Seiten Scripture,

04:13.750 --> 04:15.680
one of the Founding Scriptures
of Heaven and Earth,

04:15.680 --> 04:20.220
said to have been used by the gods
when they created this world.

04:20.220 --> 04:23.890
It governs the evolution of life.
That is...

04:23.890 --> 04:25.930
The Seiten Scripture...

04:25.930 --> 04:28.300
Just what I'd expect of Gyumaoh's son.

04:28.300 --> 04:29.800
You certainly learn quickly.

04:29.800 --> 04:32.230
Never mind the idle talk, continue.

04:32.900 --> 04:38.970
Listen, the guardian of each of
these five scriptures is given

04:38.970 --> 04:41.110
the title of Sanzo Priest.

04:41.110 --> 04:42.640
Sanzo?!

04:42.640 --> 04:44.910
He really is a priest then!

04:45.850 --> 04:50.090
And my excellent researcher,
Doctor Ni,

04:50.090 --> 04:52.710
made a very important
discovery for me.

04:54.920 --> 05:00.290
I'm Jenyi Ni. Lord Kougaiji, your
reputation precedes you.

05:01.130 --> 05:06.630
With your permission, I shall explain
what our new discovery is,

05:06.630 --> 05:08.100
Lady Gyokumen Koushu.

05:10.510 --> 05:12.440
It's a simple thing really.

05:12.440 --> 05:14.780
Lady Gyokumen Koushu's loved one...

05:14.780 --> 05:17.680
Oh, yes, yes, he's also
your father, isn't he?

05:18.610 --> 05:20.720
At any rate, in order to
revive Lord Gyumaoh,

05:20.720 --> 05:24.050
we need the Seiten Scripture
that we have here

05:24.050 --> 05:26.380
and the Maten Scripture,
which Genjo Sanzo has.

05:27.360 --> 05:30.730
If we get both scriptures,
this experiment,

05:30.730 --> 05:34.020
the awakening of Gyumaoh,
will succeed?

05:34.830 --> 05:40.100
You want that Rasetsunyo woman
freed from her binding spell?

05:40.100 --> 05:41.900
That's right.

05:41.900 --> 05:46.170
Why don't you ask me that when you
have the scripture in your hand?

05:49.080 --> 05:51.850
Oh, she pisses me off so much!

05:51.850 --> 05:54.980
She might be my real mother,
but she's just so greedy!

05:54.980 --> 05:58.250
All right, scriptures or
scrolls or whatever.

05:58.250 --> 06:02.190
Getting one or two will be
a piece of cake for Lirin!

06:05.660 --> 06:07.130
Shall we go?

06:08.200 --> 06:11.700
These guys were just being
manipulated by demonic powers?

06:11.700 --> 06:13.170
Does that mean Kougaiji?

06:15.100 --> 06:16.570
Who knows?

06:21.110 --> 06:22.580
Hey, Sanzo.

06:23.210 --> 06:25.480
That vest you're wearing...

06:25.480 --> 06:26.850
Vest?

06:26.850 --> 06:26.980
You mean the Maten Scripture, right?
Vest?

06:26.980 --> 06:28.750
You mean the Maten Scripture, right?

06:28.750 --> 06:33.190
Yeah! That thing sure has
awesome powers!

06:33.190 --> 06:35.710
You got all those zombies in one shot!

06:37.960 --> 06:39.390
The Maten Scripture...

06:41.230 --> 06:44.430
The disturbance that's eating
away at this world

06:44.430 --> 06:47.840
and the sudden savagery
of the demons

06:47.840 --> 06:52.870
are caused by the combining
of science and black magic

06:52.870 --> 06:55.540
which is being done by whomever
is trying to revive Gyumaoh.

06:55.540 --> 06:58.980
It's due to the great negative aura
that this creates,

06:58.980 --> 07:01.680
which has spread throughout
Shangri-La.

07:02.250 --> 07:09.590
I command you, find out who's trying
to revive Gyumaoh and why,

07:09.590 --> 07:11.060
and put a stop to it!

07:12.090 --> 07:14.900
The great demon that the war god,
Crown Prince Nataku,

07:14.900 --> 07:18.070
laid low in Houtou Castle in India
hundreds of years ago...

07:18.070 --> 07:19.900
They say he refused to coexist
with humans

07:19.900 --> 07:22.670
and devoured humans
as it pleased him.

07:22.670 --> 07:23.640
Gyumaoh!

07:23.640 --> 07:24.170
All is in India!
Gyumaoh!

07:24.170 --> 07:26.410
All is in India!

07:26.410 --> 07:28.170
Head west immediately!

07:29.380 --> 07:30.210
As you wish.

07:30.210 --> 07:30.850
And one more thing.
As you wish.

07:30.850 --> 07:31.640
And one more thing.

07:32.850 --> 07:37.890
We fear that your master's memento,
the Seiten Scripture you search for,

07:37.890 --> 07:40.860
is being used in the revival
of Gyumaoh.

07:42.560 --> 07:46.630
I have the Maten Scripture which has
power to shatter the darkness.

07:46.630 --> 07:49.960
My master, Koumyou Sanzo,
had the Seiten Scripture

07:49.960 --> 07:52.800
which has power to create light.

07:52.800 --> 07:54.900
That night when I descended
the mountain,

07:54.900 --> 07:59.410
that memento was stolen
in the attack.

07:59.410 --> 08:02.070
Sanzo! Sanzo, take a look!

08:08.350 --> 08:10.150
I want an all-you-can-eat
full course meal!

08:10.750 --> 08:13.320
You want to fight more zombies?

08:13.320 --> 08:15.220
That's got nothing to do with this!

08:15.220 --> 08:16.320
Stupid monkey.

08:16.320 --> 08:16.720
I'm starving to death! I'll eat you first,
you pervy water sprite!
Stupid monkey.

08:16.720 --> 08:19.330
I'm starving to death! I'll eat you first,
you pervy water sprite!

08:19.330 --> 08:21.960
That's perfect! You just try it!

08:23.730 --> 08:24.530
What're you growling for?!

08:24.530 --> 08:25.600
I'll eat you!
What're you growling for?!

08:25.600 --> 08:25.830
Sometimes, thinking about it
doesn't get you anywhere.
I'll eat you!
What're you growling for?!

08:25.830 --> 08:26.430
Sometimes, thinking about it
doesn't get you anywhere.
I'll eat you!
You just try it!

08:26.430 --> 08:28.140
Sometimes, thinking about it
doesn't get you anywhere.
You just try it!

08:28.140 --> 08:28.840
Sometimes, thinking about it
doesn't get you anywhere.
I'll eat anything, and that
includes water sprites!

08:28.840 --> 08:30.040
I'll eat anything, and that
includes water sprites!

08:30.040 --> 08:30.210
Ah! Damn monkey! You bit me!

08:30.210 --> 08:32.110
What would you do?
Ah! Damn monkey! You bit me!

08:32.110 --> 08:33.200
Ah! Damn monkey! You bit me!

08:35.180 --> 08:36.640
Who knows?

08:40.150 --> 08:42.880
Shut up! Enough is enough!

08:46.190 --> 08:48.320
Dealing with people who don't even
realize how powerless they are

08:48.320 --> 08:52.390
and who only have an overabundance
of demands is beyond comical.

08:52.390 --> 08:53.860
It pisses me off.

08:55.400 --> 08:58.900
If I may say so, Lady Gyokumen
Koushu, there aren't many like you

08:58.900 --> 09:03.610
who would even destroy the world
itself to serve their needs.

09:03.610 --> 09:05.940
My, is that supposed to be
a compliment?

09:06.470 --> 09:10.100
Of course, Lady Gyokumen Koushu.

09:11.980 --> 09:13.950
Kougaiji!

09:13.950 --> 09:19.290
I shall return your mother,
Rasetsunyo, to you.

09:19.290 --> 09:21.080
After all, that was our promise.

09:21.890 --> 09:24.060
But there's one thing I won't concede.

09:24.060 --> 09:27.000
Gyumaoh belongs only to me.

09:27.000 --> 09:30.600
I'll become his formal wife.

09:30.600 --> 09:32.070
Do you understand?

09:38.670 --> 09:40.810
If I were to seriously fight,

09:40.810 --> 09:43.810
I could probably defeat even
Sanzo and his group.

09:43.810 --> 09:45.710
But...

09:45.710 --> 09:49.420
I realized something when I
faced them for the first time.

09:49.420 --> 09:51.980
Something about them that was
clearly different from me.

09:53.820 --> 09:56.590
Am I hesitating? Am I?

09:57.630 --> 10:02.100
That's right! In my heart, I know
just how useless this battle is!

10:02.100 --> 10:05.600
Nothing would change even
if I were to defeat them.

10:05.600 --> 10:07.440
But, Mother!

10:07.440 --> 10:10.200
I'll save you, Mother!

10:10.200 --> 10:12.570
Even if I know Gyokumen
Koushu's ambitions

10:12.570 --> 10:16.380
will only doom this world to chaos!

10:16.380 --> 10:18.870
I shall save you!

10:25.050 --> 10:26.750
Lord Kougaiji!

10:26.750 --> 10:30.490
I can't find Lady Lirin anywhere
in the castle!

10:30.490 --> 10:31.960
What?!

10:33.900 --> 10:38.000
There's one long-distance
flying dragon missing.

10:38.000 --> 10:39.470
What? A flying dragon?!

10:41.140 --> 10:42.600
Where'd she go?

10:44.370 --> 10:46.370
She didn't!

10:46.370 --> 10:47.840
That idiot!

11:03.190 --> 11:06.490
It's been a long time since we've been
to a place with so many shops!

11:07.200 --> 11:08.460
Tranquil, isn't it?

11:08.460 --> 11:08.700
Yeah...
Tranquil, isn't it?

11:08.700 --> 11:09.500
Yeah...

11:09.500 --> 11:12.900
I guess they must not have been
affected by demons that much.

11:18.010 --> 11:19.910
It looks tasty!

11:19.910 --> 11:22.410
Sanzo, I wanna eat this!

11:22.410 --> 11:23.310
Rejected.

11:23.310 --> 11:23.910
Why?! Meanie monk!
Rejected.

11:23.910 --> 11:24.810
Why?! Meanie monk!
I can't hear you.

11:24.810 --> 11:25.480
I can't hear you.

11:25.480 --> 11:25.610
Come on!
I can't hear you.

11:25.610 --> 11:27.250
Come on!
Why not let him have the meat bun?

11:27.250 --> 11:28.250
Why not?!
Why not let him have the meat bun?

11:28.250 --> 11:29.420
Why not?!
These days, brats take advantage
of you if you spoil them.

11:29.420 --> 11:31.120
Lemme eat it!
These days, brats take advantage
