11:31.120 --> 11:31.220
Lemme eat it!
Well, well, Master Priest,

11:31.220 --> 11:33.090
Droopy-eyed bastard!
Well, well, Master Priest,

11:33.090 --> 11:35.390
Meat bun!
You've totally become the housewife
who manages the family finances.

11:35.390 --> 11:36.220
Lemme eat it!
You've totally become the housewife
who manages the family finances.

11:36.220 --> 11:36.890
Lemme eat it!
Want to try dying?

11:36.890 --> 11:37.590
Want to try dying?

11:37.590 --> 11:40.620
Pardon me, you young men over there.

11:41.660 --> 11:43.490
You're travelers, are you not?

11:44.930 --> 11:49.470
I, Chin Yisou, will foretell what
awaits you on your journey.

11:49.470 --> 11:52.240
We have no interest in fortune telling.

11:52.240 --> 11:52.870
C'mon, Sanzo! Just one!
I'm really hungry!
We have no interest in fortune telling.

11:52.870 --> 11:57.450
C'mon, Sanzo! Just one!
I'm really hungry!

11:57.450 --> 11:58.910
Shut up!

12:00.750 --> 12:06.520
After all, gentlemen, I see signs
of death! How frightening!

12:08.390 --> 12:10.150
Who the hell are you?

12:11.290 --> 12:14.560
You live very close to death,
do you not?

12:14.560 --> 12:17.230
No, no, I can tell.

12:17.230 --> 12:19.400
I asked who the hell you were.

12:19.400 --> 12:22.670
Especially, yes... You.

12:22.670 --> 12:26.710
Yes, you deceive others with your
fair-seeming looks, but those eyes!

12:26.710 --> 12:31.210
You have the eyes of a sinner!

12:31.210 --> 12:33.950
Sins beyond atonement!

12:33.950 --> 12:40.460
Yes, yes, and you have a scar
on your stomach, do you not?

12:40.460 --> 12:42.860
You bastard! You trying
to pick a fight?!

12:42.860 --> 12:46.460
I'm only saying this out of concern
for you gentlemen.

12:46.460 --> 12:50.130
Though I'm just a fortune-teller
whose fortunes rarely come true.

12:50.130 --> 12:53.330
Take a look at these mah-jong pieces.

12:53.940 --> 12:55.700
Mah-jong pieces?

12:55.700 --> 12:59.940
My pieces tell of people's fates. See?

13:00.540 --> 13:03.530
Disaster walks with you!

13:05.810 --> 13:07.300
What the hell is this?!

13:08.650 --> 13:10.120
What the?!

13:12.390 --> 13:13.850
What is that?!

13:19.730 --> 13:22.060
Man, here comes another
really big one.

13:22.060 --> 13:24.200
Goku, it'll be worth eating.

13:24.200 --> 13:26.030
It looks super hard though.

13:26.030 --> 13:27.690
Hey, look at its chest!

13:30.570 --> 13:31.640
A Sanskrit character.

13:31.640 --> 13:32.070
A shikigami?
A Sanskrit character.

13:32.070 --> 13:33.810
A shikigami?

13:33.810 --> 13:36.610
Yeah, it's a form of black magic
that transforms things

13:36.610 --> 13:39.610
into monsters by sealing
an evil will inside it.

13:39.610 --> 13:43.710
But are shikigami that big even fair?
It's unnatural!

13:45.820 --> 13:46.890
That man...

13:46.890 --> 13:47.360
You have the eyes of a sinner!
That man...

13:47.360 --> 13:49.660
You have the eyes of a sinner!

13:49.660 --> 13:52.360
Sins beyond atonement!

13:52.360 --> 13:56.160
That fortune-teller... Could it be
this shikigami is also his?

13:56.160 --> 13:58.700
Is he one of Kougaiji's assassins too?

13:58.700 --> 14:00.170
Something doesn't fit though.

14:02.740 --> 14:04.200
He's sure going all out.

14:05.140 --> 14:06.940
Now, what to do?

14:06.940 --> 14:08.610
What else?!

14:08.610 --> 14:10.080
We just gotta beat it!

14:10.780 --> 14:12.980
I don't know who sent ya,

14:12.980 --> 14:15.120
but you better not get

14:15.120 --> 14:16.580
too high and mighty!

14:19.090 --> 14:20.640
This looks like fun!

14:21.420 --> 14:23.220
You're on, crab monster!

14:37.100 --> 14:38.900
Take that!

14:47.820 --> 14:50.220
I can't believe she just
left the dragon here.

14:51.120 --> 14:53.920
Lady Lirin must be close by.

14:55.190 --> 14:57.250
What a troublesome little...

14:59.160 --> 15:04.700
You say that, but you're actually
worried. Right, big brother?

15:04.700 --> 15:08.600
Shut up! Don't give me that
mature brother garbage.

15:09.170 --> 15:10.640
What would you know?

15:12.070 --> 15:13.540
More than you think.

15:14.110 --> 15:16.370
I think I understand a bit of what
you're going through.

15:18.310 --> 15:20.710
My old man had a mistress
too, you see.

15:22.550 --> 15:24.020
And I also had a kid brother.

15:24.720 --> 15:26.450
We had different mothers.

15:26.450 --> 15:31.120
He was a sassy little brat, but to me,
he was my dear kid brother.

15:32.130 --> 15:37.360
Well, I wasn't even able to save my
own suffering mother in the end.

15:38.430 --> 15:40.700
Seeing you brings back memories.

15:43.300 --> 15:45.140
Sorry, I said too much.

15:45.670 --> 15:47.140
Don't sweat it.

15:48.510 --> 15:51.540
And I'm not doing this
out of sympathy.

15:55.320 --> 15:56.940
It's something I decided for myself.

15:58.050 --> 15:59.920
Decided?

15:59.920 --> 16:04.430
I came to this castle out of
nowhere, but Kougaiji,

16:04.430 --> 16:07.600
you allowed me to enter your service
without any questions.

16:07.600 --> 16:09.260
And that's when I decided.

16:10.330 --> 16:14.500
That I'd dedicate my life to you.

16:15.900 --> 16:17.370
Dokugakuji...

16:18.010 --> 16:20.940
Listen to me, Kougaiji.

16:20.940 --> 16:23.380
You live as you see fit.

16:25.380 --> 16:30.870
No matter what path you choose,
we'll follow you.

16:31.750 --> 16:33.740
Our one and only Lord.

16:40.290 --> 16:42.490
Sanzo Party, I found you!

16:43.260 --> 16:46.570
I'm Lirin! I'm here to defeat you!

16:46.570 --> 16:48.030
Come and get me!

16:50.240 --> 16:53.770
Go and get her? But you know...

16:53.770 --> 16:56.300
Now, what are we to make of it?

16:56.940 --> 17:00.150
Hey, Goku, doesn't she kind of act
a lot like you?

17:00.150 --> 17:02.620
Like a female version of Goku?

17:02.620 --> 17:04.240
Goku, you go play with her.

17:05.850 --> 17:08.290
Damn it! You're not taking
me seriously, are you?!

17:08.290 --> 17:09.760
Because you think I'm a kid!

17:12.660 --> 17:15.460
Let me down! Droopy eyes!
Baldy! Hey, I've had it!

17:15.460 --> 17:16.660
Want a meat bun?
Let me down! Droopy eyes!
Baldy! Hey, I've had it!

17:16.660 --> 17:17.600
Want a meat bun?

17:17.600 --> 17:19.070
Yeah!

17:20.600 --> 17:22.470
Just what you'd expect of Sanzo.

17:22.470 --> 17:25.030
He certainly is good at handling
small animals.

17:25.670 --> 17:26.770
That's as far as you go!

17:26.770 --> 17:27.170
What?!
That's as far as you go!

17:27.170 --> 17:28.440
What?!

17:28.440 --> 17:29.910
So we meet again.

17:31.810 --> 17:33.250
Kougaiji!

17:33.250 --> 17:35.740
I've come to get my younger
sister back!

17:36.280 --> 17:38.990
Go right ahead! Please take
her home with you!

17:38.990 --> 17:40.540
Hi-hi, brother!

17:42.420 --> 17:44.760
You idiot! Get over here!

17:44.760 --> 17:47.660
You better not just take her
and get out of here again!

17:47.660 --> 17:49.360
Well, Kougaiji?!

17:51.970 --> 17:53.230
Of course not!

17:53.230 --> 17:53.470
All right! Let's finish what
we started last time!
Of course not!

17:53.470 --> 17:56.490
All right! Let's finish what
we started last time!

18:02.480 --> 18:03.940
Excuse me...

18:05.010 --> 18:06.350
Yes?

18:06.350 --> 18:06.510
Yes?
May I ask for you to be my opponent?

18:06.510 --> 18:09.220
May I ask for you to be my opponent?

18:09.220 --> 18:12.150
I've decided that from now on,
I'd like to live for Lord Kougaiji

18:12.150 --> 18:13.920
and be of service to him.

18:14.690 --> 18:16.280
That's a very worthy goal.

18:26.130 --> 18:29.190
So I guess you're my opponent, Mister.

18:30.240 --> 18:31.700
Sha Gojyo?

18:32.740 --> 18:34.740
I thought it might be you.

18:34.740 --> 18:37.710
I didn't really believe it until I
met you face to face though.

18:38.550 --> 18:40.010
You can't be...

18:41.250 --> 18:42.720
Yo!

18:43.520 --> 18:44.980
Brother!

18:57.630 --> 18:59.900
You kidding me? Why?

19:00.940 --> 19:03.130
Why are you here?!

19:06.640 --> 19:09.180
Sorry for the late introduction.

19:09.180 --> 19:11.840
I'm a direct subordinate of Kougaiji.

19:14.720 --> 19:16.240
My name's Dokugakuji.

19:18.420 --> 19:20.550
I'm the sort who never yields

19:20.550 --> 19:22.520
once I've made up my mind
on how to live my life.

19:23.760 --> 19:25.220
Sorry.

19:27.060 --> 19:29.700
You read my mind. I'm...

19:29.700 --> 19:31.220
I'm like that too!

19:35.540 --> 19:37.440
Over here, Kougaiji!

19:37.440 --> 19:38.960
You impertinent, scurrying rat!

19:53.850 --> 19:55.020
Did I get him?!

19:55.020 --> 19:55.320
Let's get serious here!
Did I get him?!

19:55.320 --> 19:56.620
Let's get serious here!

19:56.620 --> 19:58.090
What?!

20:10.070 --> 20:12.440
He's gotten stronger.

20:13.540 --> 20:15.210
But...

20:15.210 --> 20:16.980
Interesting.

20:16.980 --> 20:18.440
Isn't it?!

20:19.510 --> 20:21.880
That kick was quite something.

20:22.650 --> 20:25.850
But I'll pay you back twice over!

20:27.190 --> 20:28.990
Got it?

20:28.990 --> 20:30.460
That's the spirit!

20:31.460 --> 20:33.130
Here I come!

20:33.130 --> 20:34.560
Bring it on!

20:45.940 --> 20:52.310
That's right, even sudden
tragedies come

20:52.310 --> 20:57.690
Looking good-natured, without
cause for suspicion

20:57.690 --> 21:03.190
Don't complain, just shut up

21:03.190 --> 21:06.590
And look up

21:06.590 --> 21:12.400
I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is

21:12.400 --> 21:17.840
Before any talk of dreams or hopes

21:17.840 --> 21:23.140
It's probably the same for everyone

21:23.140 --> 21:27.080
You must fight against yourself

21:34.090 --> 21:37.730
The sun sets and a new day comes

21:37.730 --> 21:39.690
Repeating is one change

21:39.690 --> 21:43.830
Don't avert eyes from differences

21:43.830 --> 21:47.970
Your nerve and soul to the limit

21:47.970 --> 21:50.640
Go forward now

21:50.640 --> 21:55.680
Standing next to the taut pressure

21:55.680 --> 22:01.080
I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone

22:01.080 --> 22:06.520
It's probably the same for everyone

22:06.520 --> 22:10.580
You must fight against yourself
